              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akailĩĩle kw’oko mũtwenĩ wa nthembo yake, na kũmyũaĩa mũomonĩ wa ĩeema ya kũmbanĩa: na ana ma Aluni ala athembi makaminzangĩsya nthakame ĩũlũ wa kĩthembeo kw’onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akamũthembee Yeova nthembo na mwaki kuma nthembonĩ ya nthembo sya mũuo; koa ũla ũvw’ĩkĩte mavu, na mathunya onthe ala me ĩũlũ wa mavu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
