          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akailĩĩle kw’oko mũtwenĩ wayo, na kũmyũaĩa mbee wa ĩeema ya kũmbanĩa; na ana ma Aluni makaminzangĩsye nthakame yayo ĩũlũ wa kĩthembeo kw’onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kuma nthĩnĩ wayo akathembe nthembo yake, nayo nĩ nthembo ĩvĩvĩaw’a Yeova na mwaki; koa ũla ũvw’ĩkĩte mavu, na mathunya onthe ala me ĩũlũ wa mavu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
